24
00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:21.414
(Eunwon) Kamu berkemas, tutup bot.

25
00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:22.816
[Bunyi bip]
(Sanghyun) Tolong bawa saya kereta kecemasan.

26
00:01:22.883 --> 00:01:24.551
- (Yunjeong) Ya!
- (Lee Young) Gulung kasa.

27
00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:36.798
memadam kebakaran

28
00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:41.868
Saya akan bertukar tangan

29
00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:44.238
[Bunyi penggera ECG]
[Nafas Eunwon berat]

30
00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:46.907
(Sanghyeon) Tolong beri saya epinefrin

31
00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:56.283
[Bunyi henti ECG]

32
00:01:56.350 --> 00:01:59.066
[Suami Eunju menangis]

33
00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:00.400
(Ibu Eunju) Bajingan kamu...
[muzik sedih]

34
00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:04.124
Saya perlu memberi mereka makan dan memeluk mereka.
[Suami Eunju menangis]

35
00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:08.029
Saya sangat ingin berjumpa dengan awak...

36
00:02:08.096 --> 00:02:10.464
[Suami Eun-ju dan ibu Eun-ju menangis]

37
00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:13.600
(Ibu Eunju) [Sebak] Eunju!

38
00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:16.069
(Suami Eunju) [Sebak] Sayang!

39
00:02:16.136 --> 00:02:17.745
[Bunyi titisan air]

40
00:02:17.812 --> 00:02:18.878
(Nama Eunju) Eunju!

41
00:02:18.945 --> 00:02:20.106
[Bunyi darah mencurah]
[muzik gugup]

42
00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:21.508
[Lee Young terkejut]

43
00:02:21.575 --> 00:02:22.643
[Seruan Lee Young yang malu]

44
00:02:23.177 --> 00:02:26.367
[Nafas berat Lee Young]

45
00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:28.434
[Eun-joo mengejek menangis]

46
00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.652
[Bunyi titisan air]

47
00:02:35.434 --> 00:02:37.157
[Kesan bunyi disedut masuk]
[Lee Young mengerang terkejut]

48
00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.030
[Nafas kasar]

49
00:02:51.734 --> 00:02:52.773
[mengeluh]

50
00:02:58.745 --> 00:02:59.780
[mengeluh ringan]

51
00:02:59.847 --> 00:03:02.449
[Muzik: 'Suatu Hari Saya Akan Menjadi Bijaksana'
Lagu tema 'Life as a Major']

52
00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:12.225
[bunyi siren]

53
00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:15.133
[Muzik tenang]

54
00:03:18.432 --> 00:03:20.767
Oh, Cikgu Dahye pergi bercuti.

55
